\"where was I\", starting the day\n- [M365 agent access](project_m365-agent-access.md) — automating Teams, Outlook, Excel, Word or PowerPoint\n- [Harness time budget](feedback_harness-time-budget.md) — before any hook/skill/memory/system fix outside Friday's slot\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","session_id":"23527a7f-7f09-48ab-a034-d355d7ed9423","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop\\DEV","sessionId":"23527a7f-7f09-48ab-a034-d355d7ed9423","version":"2.1.294","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"568eb214-fe84-4e94-9bf0-85fd29b24ef3","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"session_context","context":{"userEmail":"The user's email address is eric.rash11@gmail.com. Use it only to identify the user, such as for authorship, attribution, or filtering their own work. Never send it to an unrelated service, such as in a request header, URL, or payload, unless the user explicitly asks.","gitStatus":"This is the git status at the start of the conversation. Note that this status is a snapshot in time, and will not update during the conversation.\n\nCurrent branch: main\n\nMain branch (you will usually use this for PRs): main\n\nGit user: Eric Rash\n\nStatus:\n(clean)\n\nRecent commits:\na959cd8 WORKFLOW.md: every slash command, grouped by where it fits\nfbfe407 Windows closeout 2026-10-03 (evening)\n7923a07 WORKFLOW/COMMANDS: fixes recorded, stale schedule facts corrected\n031b5b6 WORKFLOW.md: the ideal day, week and semester across every skill and job\n9c5303e router: project-triage is the live board now (render.py retired)"}},"type":"attachment","uuid":"16fe71d3-6ecd-485a-a548-89de36ddff7e","timestamp":"2026-10-08T10:57:46.732Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nAs you answer the user's questions, you can use the following context:\n# userEmail\nThe user's email address is eric.rash11@gmail.com. Use it only to identify the user, such as for authorship, attribution, or filtering their own work. Never send it to an unrelated service, such as in a request header, URL, or payload, unless the user explicitly asks.\n# gitStatus\nThis is the git status at the start of the conversation. Note that this status is a snapshot in time, and will not update during the conversation.\n\nCurrent branch: main\n\nMain branch (you will usually use this for PRs): main\n\nGit user: Eric Rash\n\nStatus:\n(clean)\n\nRecent commits:\na959cd8 WORKFLOW.md: every slash command, grouped by where it fits\nfbfe407 Windows closeout 2026-10-03 (evening)\n7923a07 WORKFLOW/COMMANDS: fixes recorded, stale schedule facts corrected\n031b5b6 WORKFLOW.md: the ideal day, week and semester across every skill and job\n9c5303e router: project-triage is the live board now (render.py retired)\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","session_id":"23527a7f-7f09-48ab-a034-d355d7ed9423","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop\\DEV","sessionId":"23527a7f-7f09-48ab-a034-d355d7ed9423","version":"2.1.294","gitBranch":"main"}
