{"parentUuid":"ed974200-236e-40e7-bf8f-dfef9770c47f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfpfuwHiFby7SZ9P6zp72","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Your own tasks are in two groups. Ten are already disabled from earlier. Two are still active.\n\n**Still active (disable these):**\n\n| Task | Trigger |\n|---|---|\n| DailyGmailDigest | 5:00 PM every day |\n| KeystoneOS-StackDoctor | 10:30 AM every Monday |\n\n**Already disabled (nothing to change, just record them):**\n\n| Task | Trigger |\n|---|---|\n| CFB-ForecastCaptureReminder | 7:25 AM Wed/Thu/Fri |\n| KeystoneOS Morning | 6:00 AM weekdays |\n| KeystoneOS-Adjudicate | 2:30 AM Sundays |\n| KeystoneOS-AgySync | 4:55 PM, then repeating |\n| KeystoneOS-DailyBackup | 12:30 AM every day |\n| KeystoneOS-MsysKeepAlive | At log on |\n| KeystoneOS-Reconcile | Multiple triggers |\n| KeystoneOS-Rituals | Multiple triggers |\n| MorningBriefing | 7:20 AM weekdays |\n| Refresh_All_Data | 8:00 PM every day |\n\nLeave everything else alone: Adobe, Edge, OneDrive, iGoAudio, SensorFramework, Git for Windows Updater, and USER_ESRV_SVC_QUEENCREEK, which is an Intel system service.\n\n## Phase 1, Step 4: Export all 12 and disable the 2 active ones\n\n1. In File Explorer, create a folder named `root-library` inside `G:\\My Drive\\_FROM_WORK_LAPTOP\\scheduled-tasks`.\n2. For each of the 12 tasks above, click it, click **Export...**, and save it into `root-library`. Export the already-disabled ones too, because they hold the full schedules you'll need for porting.\n3. Click **DailyGmailDigest**, then **Disable**.\n4. Click **KeystoneOS-StackDoctor**, then **Disable**.\n\nReply \"done\" when all 12 are exported and every one of them shows **Disabled**. That finishes Phase 1.\n\nneeds input: Export the 12 tasks to scheduled-tasks\\root-library, disable DailyGmailDigest and KeystoneOS-StackDoctor, then reply \"done\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3232,"cache_read_input_tokens":86586,"output_tokens":1214,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":424},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3232,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1214,"cache_read_input_tokens":86586,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3232,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3232},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"5cad4cd5-9753-417e-86af-e6c09c2a8aa2","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfpfuvX5n2oxoFaVJT9ar","type":"assistant","uuid":"67387134-b9f2-4266-a9b2-a711afb73215","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:13:48.296Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"23527a7f-7f09-48ab-a034-d355d7ed9423","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop\\DEV","sessionId":"23527a7f-7f09-48ab-a034-d355d7ed9423","version":"2.1.294","gitBranch":"main"}
