{"parentUuid":"9f0bdf0c-e4bb-43d9-bdb4-838658631402","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfpgWaKccCtjXWS8Ht9a4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, copy all of it. It's your accumulated context, it's small, and once the laptop is gone it can't be recreated. In Phase 4 we'll copy these three folders from `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude`:\n\n| Folder | What it holds |\n|---|---|\n| `global-memory` | USER.md, MEMORY.md, error log |\n| `projects` | Per-project memory for every workspace, plus Claude session transcripts (the equivalent of your `.codex` history) |\n| `claude-memory-compiler` | Daily logs and the ~230 compiled knowledge articles. We'll skip its `.venv` folder, which is a rebuildable Python environment. |\n\nWe won't copy all of `.claude`. It holds a credentials file with login tokens, and those shouldn't sit on Drive. It also holds plugin caches that just add clutter. The rest of `.claude` (skills, hooks, settings) should already be on GitHub. Before we rename it in Phase 7, we'll check that nothing there is unpushed.\n\nI'll walk you through each folder in Phase 4. Finish Phase 2 first:\n\nneeds input: Close VS Code, RStudio, Excel, Power BI and all terminal windows, then reply \"done\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":117,"cache_read_input_tokens":97313,"output_tokens":780,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":370},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":117,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":780,"cache_read_input_tokens":97313,"cache_creation_input_tokens":117,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":117},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":nul