{"parentUuid":"69f502a1-feb7-466a-9f62-faf62016c029","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfpgXbXa6tiQcmjK776z6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Copying everything works. Sorting it out later on the Mac is a reasonable plan. In Phase 4 we'll copy the whole `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\.claude` folder into `_FROM_WORK_LAPTOP`, next to `.codex`.\n\nI'd make one exception: once the copy finishes, delete `.credentials.json` from the copy on Drive. That file holds a live Claude login token. It's useless on another machine, because the Mac and VPS sign in on their own, but anyone who got hold of it could use it. Everything else stays. If you'd rather keep that file too, that's your call. Tell me and I'll drop the step.\n\nTwo things to expect in Phase 4:\n\n- `.claude` may be a few GB, because of transcripts, plugins, and the compiler's `.venv`. We'll check its size first so you know how long the upload will take.\n- `.codex` may contain a similar login file (`auth.json`). The same reasoning applies there.\n\nNow, Phase 2:\n\nneeds input: Close VS Code, RStudio, Excel, Power BI and all terminal windows, then reply \"done\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":129,"cache_read_input_tokens":98210,"output_tokens":595,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":229},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":129,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":595,"cache_read_input_tokens":98210,"cache_creation_input_tokens":129,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":129},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassi