{"parentUuid":"a5a963d9-e4d4-4e87-b71e-6c5fbe52382c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfpgg89YyYxuDDAZM2oPG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Phase 3 checks out. Drive for Desktop is syncing **DEV** to **Computers**, and it reports **12.8 GB**. All your apps are closed, so Phase 2 is done too.\n\nDrive also shows **3 errors**. We'll clear those in Phase 5, after the Phase 4 copies are in.\n\nBefore moving on, let's make sure 12.8 GB really covers all of DEV and that Drive isn't skipping anything big.\n\n## Phase 3, Step 2: Check DEV's real size on the laptop\n\n1. Open File Explorer and go to `C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop`.\n2. Right-click the **DEV** folder and choose **Properties**.\n3. Wait until the **Size** number stops climbing. With this many files it can take a minute or two.\n4. Tell me three numbers: **Size**, **Size on disk**, and the **Contains** line (files and folders).\n\nIf the size is close to 12.8 GB, we're good. If it's a lot bigger, Drive is skipping something, and we'll track it down before Phase 4.\n\nneeds input: Open Properties on Desktop\\DEV and send the Size, Size on disk, and Contains numbers once they stop changing."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1225,"cache_read_input_tokens":99725,"output_tokens":656,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":256},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1225,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":656,"cache_read_input_tokens":99725,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1225,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1225},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null