{"parentUuid":"d0a62bb2-a676-424c-8e2e-5668ee4e428f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfpvepF84UyDcCnSd3SrZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Other computers** is there, so Phase 6 can compare sizes on this laptop without the website.\n\nTwo other things in your sidebar I want to come back to in Phase 4, since they might hold files that exist only here:\n\n- **CRASHBOX (D:)**: an external drive. Is it a backup drive you'll keep?\n- **Linux**: the WSL Linux file system. Docker uses it, but you may also have files in a Linux home folder.\n\nNo need to answer now.\n\n## Phase 3, Step 6: Open Other computers\n\n1. Double-click **Other computers**.\n2. Tell me what's inside. I'm expecting a folder named after this laptop, something like \"My Laptop\" or \"BU-1979FJ4\".\n3. Open that folder and check that **DEV** is in it.\n\nDon't check any sizes yet. Opening folders here is fine; it doesn't download anything.\n\nneeds input: Open G:\\Other computers, then the laptop folder, and tell me what's listed (looking for DEV)."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":75738,"cache_read_input_tokens":32373,"output_tokens":436,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":112},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":75738,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":436,"cache_read_input_tokens":32373,"cache_creation_input_tokens":75738,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":75738},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}},"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8ec9616b-3d45-4f03