{"parentUuid":"cdbe86c6-f398-4671-ba5e-115db48a848a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfqASkJJ9ewkhpmLiH5DE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's where the bulk is:\n\n| Folder | Size | Files | What it is | Recommendation |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| .vscode | 8.53 GB | 81,466 | Editor extensions (Windows builds) | Skip. VS Code reinstalls them. |\n| .claude | 5.18 GB | 48,766 | Your memory, transcripts, skills, hooks | **Bring, as a zip** |\n| .cache | 4.61 GB | 26,027 | Tool download caches | Skip. Rebuilt automatically. |\n| .codex | 3.28 GB | 39,069 | Codex session history | **Bring, as a zip** |\n| .local | 1.70 GB | 55 | uv and other Windows program files | Skip. They won't run on a Mac or Linux. |\n| .memsearch | 992 MB | 10,112 | Search index | Skip. Rebuilt from your notes. |\n| .cursor, .docker, .ollama | ~23 MB | small | Settings | Bring |\n| ~85 other dot-folders | ~0.6 GB | ~10,000 | Tool configs | Bring |\n\n**My recommendation:** bring your own data and skip the four bulk folders. They're either Windows-only programs or caches that rebuild themselves, so moving them adds 16 GB and about 118,000 files with nothing you can't regenerate.\n\n**Why zip `.claude` and `.codex`:** a zip is one large file instead of about 88,000 small ones, so Drive uploads it in minutes rather than hours. On the Mac you just double-click it to unpack. Explorer can make the zip itself, with nothing to install.\n\nYou said earlier you wanted everything, so it's your call:\n\n- **A (recommended):** zip `.claude` and `.codex`, copy the other small dot-folders and dot-files as-is, and skip `.vscode`, `.cache`, `.local` and `.memsearch`.\n- **B:** same as A, but also zip the four bulk folders and bring them too. That adds about 16 GB.\n\nneeds input: Reply A or B."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3235,"cache_read_input_tokens":138438,"output_tokens":1613,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":921},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3235,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1613,"cache_read_input_tokens":138438,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3235,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3235},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"87bbccf8-2a5b-411f-9619-a9812a971548","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfqASjcN5z4wEdhooStNR","type":"assistant","uuid":"f2884388-5a4f-4c49-8279-f40ecb63f26d","timestamp":"2026-10-08T17:28:03.991Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"23527a7f-7f09-48ab-a034-d355d7ed9423","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop\\DEV","sessionId":"23527a7f-7f09-48ab-a034-d355d7ed9423","version":"2.1.294","gitBranch":"main"}
