{"parentUuid":"8489bebc-44ff-4bc3-be92-73388ba00908","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfqBHKRw8LcJZ5Y3rjY8r","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes. Explorer runs each one in its own progress window. Both read from C: and write to D:, so each will run a bit slower, but the total time comes out about the same and you don't have to wait between them. Keep it to **2 or 3 at a time**. More than that and the external drive spends its time switching between them instead of writing.\n\nThe ones left to make:\n\n1. codex.zip (.codex)\n2. vscode.zip (.vscode), the biggest, so start it early\n3. cache.zip (.cache)\n4. local.zip (.local)\n5. memsearch.zip (.memsearch)\n6. dotfolders-other.zip (all the other dot-folders, the next step after these)\n\nA good order is **codex + vscode now**, then **cache + local + memsearch** when those finish. Each uses the same settings: **Compress to > Additional options**, location `D:\\_FROM_WORK_LAPTOP`, the name above, format ZIP.\n\nIf any window shows an error, like \"file in use\" or \"path too long\", screenshot it before clicking anything.\n\nneeds input: Start the zips (2–3 at a time), then send the size of each finished zip in D:\\_FROM_WORK_LAPTOP, plus any error screenshots."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":101,"cache_read_input_tokens":147265,"output_tokens":482,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":88},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":101,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":482,"cache_read_input_tokens":147265,"cache_creation_input_tokens":101,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":101},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e90dc174-ab26-4555-9592-3211f269d495","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfqBHJyeZ3Kf22s2725Y8","type":"assistant","uuid":"fc60f4a0-5713-4bc0-84b2-a37422def18e","timestamp":"2026-10-08T17:38:52.025Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"23527a7f-7f09-48ab-a034-d355d7ed9423","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\eric_rash\\Desktop\\DEV","sessionId":"23527a7f-7f09-48ab-a034-d355d7ed9423","version":"2.1.294","gitBranch":"main"}
